      "number": 21,
      "authors": "박미정",
      "title": "가정과교육에서의 창의･인성 수업 모델 개발 -‘옷차림과 자기 표현’ 단원을 중심으로-",
      "titleEn": "The Development Teaching Models for Creativity and Personality Education in Home Economics Education - Focusing on the Unit 'Clothing and self-expression'-",
