      "title": "한·일 중학교 가정교과서의 녹색생활교육 내용분석",
      "titleEn": "Content Analyses of Green Life-Educational Materials in Korean and Japanese Middle School Home Economics Textbooks",
      "journal": "한국가정과교육학회지",
      "year": 2011,
